{"seq":3,"slug":"structural-properties","title":"结构性质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/metrics/structural-properties","wordCount":1460,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"结构性质\">结构性质</h1><p>随便挑两个陌生人，平均只需六次转介就能把他们连上——「六度分隔」之所以反直觉，是因为它揭示了真实网络的全局形态远比想象的紧凑。结构性质就是这样一组<strong>描述整张图</strong>而非单个节点的宏观指标。如果说 <a href=\"centrality\">中心性</a> 回答「谁重要」、<a href=\"community-detection\">社区发现</a> 回答「分成几群」，那么结构性质回答「这张图整体长什么样」。这一篇讲清四类核心宏观性质，以及它们如何把真实网络与随机网络区分开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>结构性质围绕几个独立的宏观维度：局部抱团程度、全局可达距离、度分布形态、相似节点是否相连。下图把它们组织起来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  SP[结构性质] --&gt; CLU[聚类系数]&#10;  CLU --&gt; TRI[三角形/朋友的朋友]&#10;  SP --&gt; DIST[路径与直径]&#10;  DIST --&gt; SW[小世界]&#10;  SP --&gt; DEGD[度分布]&#10;  DEGD --&gt; SF[无标度/重尾]&#10;  SP --&gt; ASS[同配性]&#10;  ASS --&gt; HUB[枢纽偏好]&#10;  SW --&gt; COMBINE[高聚类+短路径]&#10;  SF --&gt; POWER[幂律 P k ~ k^-gamma]\">graph TD\n  SP[结构性质] --&gt; CLU[聚类系数]\n  CLU --&gt; TRI[三角形/朋友的朋友]\n  SP --&gt; DIST[路径与直径]\n  DIST --&gt; SW[小世界]\n  SP --&gt; DEGD[度分布]\n  DEGD --&gt; SF[无标度/重尾]\n  SP --&gt; ASS[同配性]\n  ASS --&gt; HUB[枢纽偏好]\n  SW --&gt; COMBINE[高聚类+短路径]\n  SF --&gt; POWER[幂律 P k ~ k^-gamma]</pre><p>下表把四类性质和「它们如何区分真实网络与随机网络」对照起来。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>度量</th>\n<th>随机图（ER）</th>\n<th>多数真实网络</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>聚类系数</td>\n<td>邻居间成边比例</td>\n<td>很低</td>\n<td>很高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平均路径长度</td>\n<td>点对平均距离</td>\n<td>短</td>\n<td>同样短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>度分布</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 形态</td>\n<td>泊松（轻尾）</td>\n<td>幂律（重尾）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同配性</td>\n<td>度相关性</td>\n<td>≈0</td>\n<td>因网络而异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"聚类系数-朋友的朋友也是朋友\">聚类系数：朋友的朋友也是朋友</h2><p>聚类系数衡量「我的两个朋友之间也互为朋友」的概率，即 <a href=\"../foundations/graph-basics\">图的基本概念</a> 里邻域内部的连边密度。节点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的局部聚类系数是它邻居之间实际边数与最大可能边数之比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_v = \\frac{2 e_v}{k_v (k_v - 1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其邻居间的实际边数。全图聚类系数取所有节点的平均，或用全局三角形闭合率（传递性）。真实社交网络的聚类系数普遍很高（0.1–0.6），远超同规模随机图——因为人际关系天然成团。注意聚类系数只在能形成三角形的网络里有意义，<a href=\"../foundations/network-types\">网络类型</a> 提过的二部图不含奇数环，必须改用专门的二部聚类度量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小世界-又短又抱团\">小世界：又短又抱团</h2><p>小世界现象是两个看似矛盾的性质同时成立：<strong>平均路径长度很短</strong>（任意两点几步可达）且<strong>聚类系数很高</strong>（局部抱团严重）。纯随机图路径短但不抱团，规则网格抱团但路径长，真实网络却兼得二者。</p>\n<p>判定小世界的常用做法是比较两个比值：真实图的聚类系数应远高于同规模随机图，而平均路径长度应与随机图相当。小世界系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = (C/C_{rand})/(L/L_{rand})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 显著大于 1 即认为是小世界。这个现象的生成机制——在规则网格上随机重连少量边——正是 Watts–Strogatz 模型，详见 <a href=\"../models/random-graph-models\">随机图模型</a>。少数「长程边」就足以把抱团的局部世界缝合成全局可达的网络，这也是六度分隔的数学解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无标度与重尾度分布\">无标度与重尾度分布</h2><p>把真实网络的度分布画出来，常看到极少数节点度极高（枢纽）、绝大多数节点度很低，呈<strong>重尾</strong>。许多网络的度分布近似服从幂律：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k) \\sim k^{-\\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8213em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>指数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 多在 2 到 3 之间。这类网络被称为<strong>无标度网络</strong>——之所以叫「无标度」，是因为幂律在对数坐标下是直线，不存在一个「典型」的度作为特征尺度。它与随机图的泊松度分布形成鲜明对比（<a href=\"../foundations/graph-basics\">图的基本概念</a> 里提过度分布是区分网络类型的第一张体检表）。</p>\n<p>无标度有重要后果：网络对随机故障极其鲁棒（随机删点大概率删到的是低度节点，无伤大雅），却对针对性攻击极其脆弱（删掉几个枢纽就可能让网络瓦解）。需要提醒的是，近年研究指出「真实网络普遍幂律」被过度宣称——很多网络只是重尾，未必严格幂律，拟合时应做统计检验而非肉眼看直线，这一点呼应 <a href=\"../practice/applications-pitfalls\">应用与陷阱</a>。无标度的成因是优先连接，见 <a href=\"../models/random-graph-models\">随机图模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同配性与其他宏观量\">同配性与其他宏观量</h2><p>同配性（assortativity）衡量「相似的节点是否倾向于相连」，最常用的是度同配——高度节点是否爱连高度节点。它用度相关系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\in [-1, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 度量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 为同配（如社交网络，名人互相认识），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 为异配（如技术网络，枢纽连大量叶子）。同配性影响网络的鲁棒性和传播动力学，是区分网络成因的重要线索。</p>\n<p>除上述四大类，常用的宏观量还有：<strong>密度</strong>（实际边数与最大可能边数之比，刻画整体稀疏程度）、<strong>直径与平均距离</strong>（<a href=\"../foundations/graph-basics\">图的基本概念</a> 里定义过）、以及<strong>连通分量的规模分布</strong>（最大连通分量是否覆盖几乎整张图）。这些量共同构成一张网络的「宏观指纹」，是 <a href=\"../models/random-graph-models\">随机图模型</a> 要去复现的目标，也是判断社区、中心性等结果是否可信的背景基准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>结构性质描述整张图的宏观形态，尺度大于中心性（节点）与社区（中观）。</li>\n<li>聚类系数衡量邻居间抱团程度，真实网络远高于随机图；二部图需用专门度量。</li>\n<li>小世界=短路径+高聚类，由 Watts–Strogatz 的少量长程重连解释，是六度分隔的机制。</li>\n<li>无标度网络度分布重尾、近似幂律 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∼</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(k)\\sim k^{-\\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，对随机故障鲁棒、对针对攻击脆弱；「普遍幂律」被高估，需统计检验。</li>\n<li>同配性、密度、直径、连通分量规模共同构成网络的宏观指纹。</li>\n<li>这些性质是 <a href=\"../models/random-graph-models\">随机图模型</a> 要复现的目标，也是验证其他度量结果可信度的基准。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"结构性质","id":"结构性质"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"聚类系数：朋友的朋友也是朋友","id":"聚类系数-朋友的朋友也是朋友"},{"level":2,"text":"小世界：又短又抱团","id":"小世界-又短又抱团"},{"level":2,"text":"无标度与重尾度分布","id":"无标度与重尾度分布"},{"level":2,"text":"同配性与其他宏观量","id":"同配性与其他宏观量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"社区发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/metrics/community-detection"},"next":{"title":"随机图模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/network-graph-analysis/models/random-graph-models"}}